>如果你是一名教师，你会如何履行幼儿园任务？</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-block\">4. 课堂总结。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-block\">5. 布置作业。</div>\n  <div class=\"quote-line\">有家长说\"我们的孩子没上幼儿园，发展的也很好\"，谈看法。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sub-block\">6. 板书设计：</div>\n  <div class=\"board-block\">\n    <div class=\"subheading\">新时期幼儿园双重任务的特点：</div>\n    <ol class=\"sub-numbered\">\n      <li>教育对象<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span></li>\n      <li>服务范围<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span></li>\n      <li>教育质量<span class=\"unclear\">[?]</span></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
